<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>No Results Found</title>

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
      background: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      text-align: center;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #0a1a3a;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #444;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .tips {
      text-align: left;
      background: #eef2ff;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      border-left: 5px solid #0a1a3a;
    }

    .tips p {
      margin: 8px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .back-button {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      background: #0a1a3a;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 18px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">
    <h1>No County-Held Funds Found</h1>

    <p>
      We searched all available California county databases and didn’t find any
      matches for the name you entered.
    </p>

    <div class="tips">
      <p><strong>Try the following:</strong></p>
      <p>• Check spelling carefully</p>
      <p>• Try a maiden name or previous last name</p>
      <p>• Try searching with or without middle initials</p>
      <p>• Try searching for a spouse or business name</p>
    </div>

    <a href="/" class="back-button">Search Again</a>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
